iff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119229.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"We've largely removed the `PATH` environment dependencies in our buildsystem, but there's still the main prependment that always occurs right after setup. After some testing, this seems to be a largely deprecated step, as our CI builds perfectly fine without them. Instead, if we want to have something appended to the SCons environment, it should be in the form of the explicit `import_env_vars` argument\r\n\r\nAs such, all of the automatic assignment has been removed, with prior functionality being achievable via `import_env_vars` and passing the relevant keys. In addition, should any of these keys contain `PATH`, the import process will be handled via `PrependENVPath` instead","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119229/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}